# Committed as LF and checked out as LF, on every platform. Without this a
# contributor whose core.autocrlf is unset commits CRLF and the next person's
# diff is the whole file rather than the line that changed. The index is
# already uniformly LF, so this pins what is true rather than changing it.
#
# The .ps1 scripts are LF as well. Windows PowerShell has never minded, and
# splitting line endings by extension is how a repository ends up with exactly
# one machine that can produce a clean diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text. Diffing or converting these corrupts them.
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
